# PHP Programming Practices

This README contains screenshots and explanations of PHP programming practices covered in **Web Application Development - PHP & MySQL**.

---

# Practice #1: Display Introduction

## Screenshot Name

`Display.png`

## Description

This practice demonstrates how to display text in PHP using the `echo` statement.

### Code

```php
<?php

// Display intro
echo "<br> Welcome PHP";

?>
```

### Output

```text
Welcome PHP
```

## Screenshot

!(Display.png)

